PopWhileModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Pops all frames with depth >= depth from the top of the frame stack (TopDepth + RemoveLast loop), returning the shortened stack. Used by the parser to close blocks on indentation.
    Provides: PopWhile(stack, depth) -> stack.
    DependsOn: TopDepth, RemoveLast.
    Composition: Native include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../PopWhile/PopWhile.sir).
